{"post_id":27,"title":"Returns & Refunds","slug":"returns-refunds","status":"publish","elementor_data":[{"id":"47c5e7f","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"88","right":"64","bottom":"40","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":20,"column":"20","row":"20","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"1fee043","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>POLICY</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":13},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":0.18}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"5dd251d","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Returns & refunds","header_size":"h1","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":52},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.035},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.08}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"659acb5","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Last updated [DATE]</p>","text_color":"#8E8E93","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"0026ebb","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"64","bottom":"88","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"2573d86","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"The short version","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"0a692bb","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>You have [7] days from delivery to tell us you want to return something. It has to be unused and in its original packaging. We arrange the pickup. Once it reaches us and we have checked it, we refund you.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"a8dfb17","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"How to start a return","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"7a39305","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Email <a href=\"mailto:support@wabisabivibe.store\">support@wabisabivibe.store</a> with your order number and what you are sending back. You do not have to give a reason, though it helps us. We will confirm and book a pickup, usually within two working days.</p><p>Please keep the piece in the box and wrapping it arrived in. Returns that arrive loose in a courier bag often get damaged on the way, and a damaged return is harder for both of us.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"4b25c3f","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"What we cannot take back","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"b989936","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Anything that has been used, washed, oiled or treated. Anything damaged after delivery. Anything returned without its packaging. Items bought as part of a clearance or final-sale listing, where the listing said so.</p><p>Natural variation is not a defect. Wood grain differs piece to piece, glaze pools unevenly, and linen has slubs in it. We photograph honestly and describe these on every listing, so a piece that looks different from the photograph in these ways is not faulty.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"943f523","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Faulty or wrong items","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"3e30837","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>If we sent the wrong thing, or it arrived broken, that is our problem and not yours. Send photographs to <a href=\"mailto:support@wabisabivibe.store\">support@wabisabivibe.store</a> within 48 hours of delivery and we will replace it or refund it in full, including any shipping you paid. There is no restocking charge and we do not ask you to pay return freight.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"463481e","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"When you get your money","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ca3883e","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>We process the refund within [3] working days of the return reaching us and passing inspection. After that it depends on your bank, which usually takes another [5 to 7] working days for cards and less for UPI.</p><p>Prepaid orders are refunded to the original payment method. Cash on delivery orders are refunded by bank transfer, so we will ask you for account details. We will never ask for your card number, CVV, PIN or an OTP, and anyone who does is not us.</p><p>Original shipping charges are refunded only when the return is our fault.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"46ef883","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Cancellations","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"f847be6","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>You can cancel any order before it is dispatched, for a full refund, by emailing us. Once the courier has it, treat it as a return instead.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]}
